# DE4SDV IVI frame relay of the AAOS SDV guest (INC-MW-011, ADR 0025).
#
# For the eng or userdebug image of the IVI VM of the bench only: seclabel
# u:r:su:s0, with SELinux permissive as on the INC-AEBS-010 bench (bench only;
# a product needs its own SELinux domain, GAP-MW-038). CI does not build this
# file. The service is not oneshot, so init restarts the relay when it exits.
#
# The relay subscribes, through the SDV Gateway on IVI, to the broker's
# publication of the frame topic (the defaults of its options), as the
# subject de4sdv.ivi_frame_relay, bundle IviFrameRelay, instance default:
# exactly one ACL file for that subject must be on the IVI VM before it boots.
# It serves the frames on 127.0.0.1:4731, so the ingress's frame-server port
# is 4731 here.
#
# The ingress is oneshot: it exits when its connect fails or its stream
# closes. This file sets only the port of its frame server and no ingress
# trigger. The ingress defaults its frame-server host to 10.250.0.3
# (ingress/main.cpp:144 of the visualization bench), so at each of its
# starts, after its loopback server listens, the relay sets the host to
# 127.0.0.1 (--announce-property below). Setting the host also starts the
# ingress (de4sdv_aebs_ingress.rc:9-10). Then the relay sets
# de4sdv.aebs.ingress.start to 0 and 1. Until its first client connects, it
# sets 0 and 1 again every 1 s, at most 10 times, because an old ingress can
# still run or wait for its reap; after the first client it never starts the
# ingress again, unless the relay itself closed the ingress stream after a
# write stall. No option sets the discard rule: its margin is fixed at 20 ms.
#
# --log-frames gives a line per served frame (every dropped frame gives its
# line anyway). gentle_kill: init's stop sends SIGTERM first, so the relay
# unsubscribes and logs its final status before it exits, unless its worker
# is inside a gateway call; then the relay logs gateway_worker_not_joined and
# ends without unsubscribing.
service de4sdv_ivi_frame_relay /system/bin/de4sdv_ivi_frame_relay --status-period-s 10 --log-frames --announce-property de4sdv.aebs.frame_server.host=127.0.0.1 --ingress-start-property de4sdv.aebs.ingress.start
    class late_start
    gentle_kill
    user system
    group inet
    seclabel u:r:su:s0
    disabled

on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    setprop de4sdv.aebs.frame_server.port 4731
    start de4sdv_ivi_frame_relay
